          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29324001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "莉莉奈呢？！莉莉奈哪去了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "|101|！是不是你把莉莉奈藏起来了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "莉莉奈？我刚把她送去更换新配件。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "什么？！竟敢故意让我见不到莉莉奈！\n你做好求饶的准备了吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "莉莉奈已经很久没保养了。\n难道你不想让妹妹换上漂亮的新配件？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "............",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "............切！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以还是安心等着吧，她下午就回来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29324009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "警告你，如果莉莉奈有半点闪失，我不会放过你的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
